1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,380
A father begs Jesus:

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:03,840
my little girl is dying.

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:06,980
On the road, the news comes:

4
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:08,720
"Thy daughter is dead:

5
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:11,000
why troublest thou the Master any further?"

6
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:12,760
Too late.

7
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:15,760
Jesus heard it, and did not turn

8
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:16,200
back.

9
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:20,560
"Be not afraid, only believe." He went

10
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,140
into the room with her father and

11
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:23,960
mother, and took her by the hand.

12
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:29,660
"Talitha cumi." "Damsel, I say unto thee,

13
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:33,640
arise." Little girl, get up.

14
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:35,980
She got up and walked.

15
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:39,020
The news had said it was over.

16
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:41,880
Jesus had heard it, and gone on.

17
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:44,360
If you hear that it is too

18
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:46,660
late, hear Him instead:

19
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:50,520
"Be not afraid, only believe."
